<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>这是「你把整个运行时拿到手里」的价格</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 18, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #8A5A00", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>官方插件市场还没上线</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>生态要自己接</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #8A5A00", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>白名单与逐件审计要自己建</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>治理成本在你这边</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #8A5A00", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>接口还在快变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>二次开发量明显高于「引擎即用」那条路</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #8A5A00", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>04</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>生态还年轻</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>82% 的插件还是 0.x，老条目只有 7.1% 被再动过</Text></Box></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 24, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 28}}>这些不是它的缺陷，是「你把整个运行时拿到手里」这件事本身的价格。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>33 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
